 "header": "<h1 align=\"center\">Awesome Game Development Tools</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Awesome Game Development Tools\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://awesome.re\"><img src=\"https://awesome.re/badge.svg\" alt=\"Awesome\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PRs-welcome-brightgreen\" alt=\"PRs welcome\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-CC0--1.0-blue\" alt=\"License CC0 1.0\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/devanasolver/awesome-game-development-tools/commits/main\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/devanasolver/awesome-game-development-tools\" alt=\"Last commit\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/devanasolver\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Follow-@devanasolver-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"Follow on GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/devanasolver/awesome-game-development-tools/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/devanasolver/awesome-game-development-tools?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label=Star%20this%20list\" alt=\"Star this list\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/isaac49\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Buy%20me%20a%20coffee-isaac49-ffdd00?style=for-the-badge&logo=buymeacoffee&logoColor=black\" alt=\"Buy me a coffee\"></a>\n</p>\n\n> Open-source engines, frameworks, tools and libraries for making games, from 2D to 3D, plus art, audio and AI helpers. Every entry shows its license.\n\n**Rules of this list:** every repo exists, is public, is not archived, states a license and has had a commit in the last year. One plain sentence each. Star counts and claims are the authors' own, we did not test every tool. Checked 2026-10-18. See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md).",
 "footer": "## How to choose\n\n- **Check the license** of an engine before you ship and sell a game.\n- **Start with a tiny game** and finish it.\n- **Credit asset authors** and keep records.\n- **Console export** often needs extra steps or fees.\n\n## Contributing\n\nSee [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md). One entry per pull request, plain words, real sources only.\n\n## About\n\nMaintained by [@devanasolver](https://github.com/devanasolver). Listings follow the rules in CONTRIBUTING.\n\n## Sponsor me\n\nIf this list is useful, [buy me a coffee](https://buymeacoffee.com/isaac49).\n"
